    <span class="eyebrow">About Us</span>
    <h1>About BoriHomes</h1>
    <p>BoriHomes is a local housing discovery platform built specifically for Bori, Rivers State — with a strong initial focus on helping Ken Saro-Wiwa Polytechnic (Kenpoly) students find safe, affordable accommodation near campus.</p>
    <p>We also serve residents and families across Bori who are looking for their next home. Our goal is simple: make it easy to search, compare and connect with the right agent for a property — without exposing private landlord information to the public.</p>
    <h3>What we do</h3>
    <p>Agents list properties on our platform, our team reviews and approves each listing, and residents can search by budget, location, property type and bedroom count. When you find a property you like, you can send an enquiry or request an inspection directly through the site.</p>
    <h3>Our commitment to privacy</h3>
    <p>Exact addresses, landlord contact details and internal notes are never shown publicly. Only verified agents and administrators can access that information, enforced at the database and API level — not just hidden with front-end tricks.</p>
